OL,3,ATwo killed as car hits group of
OL,4,Acyclists
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree people have been arrested after a
OL,7,Fcar crashed into a group of cyclists,
OL,8,Fkilling two riders.
OL,10,FKent Police said a white Ford Focus was
OL,11,Ftravelling along Sole Street in Cobham
OL,12,Fnear Gravesend just before 07:50 BST on
OL,13,FSunday when it was involved in a
OL,14,Fcollision with three cyclists.
OL,16,FTwo of the cyclists - a man in his 60s
OL,17,Fand woman in her 50s - were confirmed
OL,18,Fdead by emergency services on the
OL,19,Fscene, the force added.
OL,21,FTheir next of kin have been informed.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
